      "group": "editorial",
      "role": "Founder, director and lead writer",
      "bio": "Fernando Nieto Lobato created estrategIA in 2023 and directs the publication as its lead writer. He is Director of Marketing and Digital Innovation at ALEPH Educational Institution. Based in Salamanca, he works across strategic consultancy, communication and technology, with a particular interest in how artificial intelligence changes politics, public institutions and the decisions they make.\n\nHe studied journalism and founded ThinkNet Consultora Estratégica in 2014. His work has involved political campaigns, public administrations, businesses and third-sector organisations, alongside teaching and the design of training programmes and political simulations. In estrategIA, he examines both practical applications of AI and their implications for democratic life, connecting technological developments with questions of public responsibility, institutional capacity and judgement.",
